fore relying on it."}]}, {"id": "910a00bd-4cc2-4fb0-81f2-e9bf7f946c17", "type": "topic", "title": "Job-Order, Process, and Operation Costing", "description": "Study traditional product-costing systems and the situations where each produces useful or misleading results. Build cost flows for customized jobs, continuous processes, and hybrid production settings.", "children": [{"id": "e5cd20eb-5652-4063-b06a-5964aec5d11c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Job-order costing", "children": [{"id": "0c517668-f894-4ef7-848d-9929243eaeb2", "type": "concept", "title": "job cost sheet"}, {"id": "238de10d-3d19-400b-8ca6-09cdf67ea12e", "type": "concept", "title": "materials requisition"}, {"id": "0a38448c-f587-4349-94dc-e7758c00f41f", "type": "concept", "title": "labor time ticket"}, {"id": "6605350f-0bb1-4b1c-80dd-abe2a81b45a3", "type": "concept", "title": "predetermined overhead rate"}, {"id": "54a8ef8a-3bad-43a8-af43-09ddef64d5a5", "type": "concept", "title": "actual overhead"}, {"id": "91990a13-11c8-4977-bbc0-cbcce39958d1", "type": "concept", "title": "applied overhead"}, {"id": "61970b00-0062-48fe-8a6a-e707aded5d6e", "type": "concept", "title": "underapplied overhead"}, {"id": "647e2a2b-630c-4618-b02c-762b989e6936", "type": "concept", "title": "overapplied overhead"}, {"id": "c55a63a7-5ca2-4fbc-986d-8ddff42406cb", "type": "concept", "title": "cost of goods manufactured"}, {"id": "3b475ff6-df52-4fee-89f4-694a502879f5", "type": "concept", "title": "job profitability"}], "description": "Students learn costing for customized work where costs attach to specific jobs or orders."}, {"id": "b608556c-4428-429d-a7ad-7565888873a6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Process costing", "children": [{"id": "efae9590-e79a-4192-98b7-aa81d8575ed7", "type": "concept", "title": "equivalent units"}, {"id": "cd095554-fd14-4865-ab42-64784b814901", "type": "concept", "title": "weighted-average method"}, {"id": "c2d1c240-025b-4d85-a8b1-712613f8804c", "type": "concept", "title": "FIFO method"}, {"id": "e89